<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43917" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐήνιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡνία</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>obedient to the rein</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					4.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					247b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵπποι -ώτατοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					467e
				</span></i>
			; of persons, <i>tractable, docile</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				730b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀγαθὸν εὐ. ὄν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					2.39
				</span></i>
			; of a disease, <i>easily yielding</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Virg.</u>
				1
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐάνιος</span>.
			Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίως</span>
			<i>patiently, tractably</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				217d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.9b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					4.7.12
				</span></i>
			.</div>
